<h1>About Pokédex Explorer</h1>

<p>
Pokédex Explorer is a Ruby on Rails web application created as part of a web development course.
</p>

<h3>Data Source</h3>

<p>
This application imports Pokémon data from the public PokeAPI using a custom seed script.
</p>

<h3>Features</h3>

<ul>

<li>Browse Pokémon</li>

<li>Search Pokémon</li>

<li>Browse by Type</li>

<li>Browse by Region</li>

<li>Pagination</li>

<li>Responsive Bootstrap design</li>

</ul>